{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Welcome to Animal Survival!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast-paced, 3D survival RPG inspired by\u00a0<i>Vampire Survivors</i>, reimagined with animals, crafting, and character progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>How to Play</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement: Use Arrow Keys to move your character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Objective: Survive until the timer runs out to beat each map</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\uddfa Survive &amp; Explore</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat maps by surviving until the timer runs out \u23f3 and something is waiting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new maps and gather coins to grow stronger \ud83d\udcb0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemy animals to collect \u00a0materials and craft better equipment \u2694\ufe0f</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udce6 Manage Your Progress</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory, character stats, and unlocks are saved automatically \u2705</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting materials are saved even if you fail - no progress lost! \ud83d\udc8e</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude80 In Development</strong><br>This game is still in active development, with a full release planned for Steam.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4064160?t=1761759414","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064160/2b041ef36d8b26ebb3502c4a3946a8ea9b3b2343/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761759414","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064160/bdcd7c857